These SVGs are the source glyphs of the 'Seti and Original' icon set of Nerd Fonts v3.5.1 (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, src/svgs), the same glyphs cornercase's TUI draws for file types and folders. Files were renamed to their file type: less.svg (Nerd Fonts' JSON glyph) is json.svg, open-folder_nf.svg is folder-open.svg, and the '_nf' suffix of the originals (folder, ruby, vim, elixir, kotlin, toml) was dropped.

